        "finalUrl": "http://localhost:3217/dashboard/3d-lab",
        "title": "3D Lab | SlateCamp",
        "bodyTextSample": "3D Interactive Lab\n\n4 INTERACTIVE MODULES AVAILABLE\n\nPARAMETRIC\nAVAILABLE\nSite Development Controls\n\nInteractive 3D lot model for PD 1096 Rules VII & VIII. Visualizes TLA, AMBF, PSO, ISA, USA, TOSL, and MACA as parametric zones. Manipulate lot dimensions and zoning class to see how development controls constrain the building footprint and open-space obligations in real time.\n\n \n\nPARAMETRIC\nAVAILABLE\nStairway Configurator\n\nMulti-law 3D stair compliance explorer — PD 1096, BP 220, BP 344, and RA 9514 evaluated in parallel with conflict detection.\n\n \n\nCALCULATOR\nAVAILABLE\nFlooring / Tile Visualizer\n\nEstimate tiles with 3D pattern preview and waste calculation\n\n \n\nPARAMETRIC\nAVAILABLE\nUnified Wall Configurator\n\nArchitectural wall cross-section showing layered material build-up for all 7 Philippine construction wall types. Visualize core, plaster, skim coat, primer, and paint layers in correct sequence with code-compliance feedback.\n\n \n\nINSTITUTIONAL",
